:: AdvanceDay {"position":"1800,725","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "dawn">>
<<set $currentMode = "temple">>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<set $returnEventPending = true>>
<<goto "Temple_AfterNight">>

:: ReturnToTempleNextDay {"position":"1950,625","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<if not $dayAdvancedToday>>
  <<set $dayCount = ($dayCount || $day || 1) + 1>>
  <<set $day = $dayCount>>
  <<set $timeOfDay = "day">>
  <<set $dayAdvancedToday = true>>
  <<run $dayLog.push("Day " + $dayCount)>>
<</if>>
<<goto "StartNewDay">>

:: StartNewDay {"position":"1925,725","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<set $dayAdvancedToday = false>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "day">>
<<set $dayCount = $day>>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolUsedToday = false>>
<<set $currentMode = "temple">>
<<if $day >= 2>>
  <<set $nightPatrolUnlocked = true>>
<</if>>
<<if $dayCount >= 3 and $secondLoopUnlocked>>
  <<set $emmaEventUnlocked = true>>
<</if>>
<<if $nightPatrolJustFinished>>
  <<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
  <<goto "Temple_AfterNight">>
<</if>>
<<goto "ReturnToTempleHub">>

:: ReturnToTempleAfterDayEnd {"position":"2050,725","size":"100,100"}
/% 호환용 alias. 하루 종료 후 복귀는 ReturnToTempleHub로 단순화한다. %/
<<goto "ReturnToTempleHub">>

:: ReturnToTempleHub {"position":"2175,725","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "day">>
<<set $currentMode = "temple">>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolUsedToday = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<set $returnTo = "Temple">>
<<set $dayEndReturn = false>>
<<if $returnEventPending>>
  <<goto "Temple_AfterNight">>
<</if>>
<<goto "Temple">>

:: Temple_AfterNight {"position":"1825,625","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "dawn">>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">늑대는 절로 돌아왔다.

밤은 아직 완전히 가시지 않았다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnEvent_Router">>
<</page>>

:: Temple_Return {"position":"2025,1200","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<updateRouteUnlocks>>
<<set $sceneCount += 1>>
<<set $returnTo = "Temple_Return">>
<<set $currentMode = "temple">>
<<if $dayEndReturn>>
  <<set $dayEndReturn = false>>
  <<set $timeOfDay = "day">>
  <<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
  <<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
  <<set $nightPatrolUsedToday = false>>
  <<goto "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "night">>
<div class="narration-screen scene-bg-night02">
<div class="narration narration-block">
밤이 왔다.

황폐한 절은 낮보다 조용했다.
늑대는 잠시 처마 아래에 섰다.
</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "Temple_Return_Choice">>
<</page>>

:: Temple_Return_Choice {"position":"2025,1260","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<set $returnTo = "Temple_Return">>
<<set $currentMode = "temple">>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "night">>
<div class="choice-screen scene-bg-night02">
<div class="choice-prompt">
오늘 밤, 무엇을 할까.
</div>

<div class="global-choice-layer">
<div class="global-choice-box">
<<if $nightPatrolUnlocked and not $nightPatrolUsedToday>>
<<choiceTo "밤 정찰을 나선다" "NightPatrol_Start">>
<</if>>
<<choiceTo "잠든다" "Dream_Router">>
<<choiceTo "절에 머문다" "ReturnEvent_Router">>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Temple_Return_Hub {"position":"2025,1325","size":"100,100"}
<<goto "Temple_Return">>

:: NightPatrol_Start {"position":"2000,750","size":"100,100"}
<<if $nightPatrolUsedToday>>
  <<goto "Temple_Return">>
<<else>>
  <<set $nightPatrolActive = true>>
  <<set $nightPatrolUsedToday = true>>
  <<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
  <<set $currentMode = "nightPatrol">>
  <<set $timeOfDay = "night">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol_LocationChoice">>
<</if>>

:: NightPatrol {"position":"2000,825","size":"100,100"}
<<goto "NightPatrol_Start">>

:: Temple_Sleep {"position":"1800,875","size":"100,100"}
<<goto "Sleep_Roll">>

:: Sleep_Roll {"position":"1800,875","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "night">>
<<set $currentMode = "sleep">>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<if $dreamUnlocked>>
  <<goto "DreamRouter">>
<<elseif $shura >= 5 or $isolation >= 7>>
  <<goto "Sleep_BadOmen">>
<<elseif $danger >= 4>>
  <<goto "Sleep_Alert">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "Sleep_Calm">>
<</if>>

:: Sleep_Calm {"position":"1800,1000","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $danger = Math.max(0, $danger - 1)>>
<<clampStats>>
<div class="narration-full">
그 밤은 조용했다.

바람은 낡은 처마를 지나갔고,
늑대는 오래 깨어 있지 않았다.
</div>

<<continueTo "AdvanceDay">>
<</page>>

:: Sleep_Alert {"position":"1925,1000","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $danger = Math.max(0, $danger - 1)>>
<<set $isolation += 1>>
<<clampStats>>
<div class="narration-full">
잠은 얕았다.

멀리서 발소리가 난 듯했고,
늑대는 몇 번이고 눈을 떴다.

새벽이 되었을 때,
손은 아직 칼자루 가까이에 있었다.
</div>

<<continueTo "AdvanceDay">>
<</page>>

:: Sleep_BadOmen {"position":"2050,1000","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
꿈속에서 누군가 웃었다.

그것이 적의 목소리였는지,
자신의 목소리였는지 알 수 없었다.

눈을 떴을 때,
방 안에는 아무도 없었다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
<<link "검을 확인한다" "AdvanceDay">>
  <<set $shura += 1>>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "손을 뗀다" "AdvanceDay">>
  <<set $shura = Math.max(0, $shura - 1)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Temple_Return_Bad {"position":"2150,1200","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $sceneCount += 1>>
<<set $danger += 1>>
<<set $isolation += 1>>



<div class="narration">
밤이 깊어간다.

늑대는 돌아왔다.

돌아왔다는 사실만이,
간신히 확실했다.
</div>

<<continueTo "Temple">>
<</page>>

:: Temple_Return_Shura {"position":"2275,1200","size":"100,100"}
<<set $shura += 1>>

<div class="narration">

손에 묻은 피가 마르지 않는다.

</div>

<<goto "Temple">>
